<title>HONG KONG: Shareholders okay Silver Eagle pref shares plan.</title>
<headline>Shareholders okay Silver Eagle pref shares plan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silver Eagle Holdings Ltd said on Friday its shareholders had approved the company's proposal to issue 100 million preference shares to its parent Grande Holdings Ltd at HK$1.00 per share.</p>
<p>In August, the company proposed to issue 100 million convertible cumulative non-voting preference shares to Grande Holdings at HK$1.00 per share.</p>
<p>Grande held 73.2 percent of Silver Eagle as at August 20.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
